{
  "id": "MAT.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 20",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga bwarng'eanyi aba jeeda madamnyeanda sabiibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda gawuurji siida bea gheeda riteawa sakteayda duw ak gagasa fuga jea ghabwar ng'eanyi aba jeeda madamnyeandaanyi bea sabiibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata nea nineajeesa buuneeda gideaba gayghoadaw lapiyeeda siguura dinaari aba gadiyeeda jeeda askwearda, ghwaat jeeda madamnyeandaanyi bea sabiibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwarita sakteayda nea gaba aseeta samwagu ak ghwadaah buuneeda suuk nea ghamiinaada aba jeeda naada nea mandeawana gadiyeeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwayeesha fugiga, ‘Aweayeena eara agooga ak goosinyi gadiyeeda aba jeeda madamnyeanda sabiibu, ak abeeda gaydagooneegwa gitoobiiwseegwa.’ Ak gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gwarita gicha siidida bea madamnyeandean nea gaba aseeta lah ea aseeteaba shageash, ak gwasinda gidida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hita aseeteaba damwanagi gabiikta gwarita gicha ak gabiikta ghwanyas fih suuk nea ghamiinaada; hean ghoanyaash nea gwayeesha, ‘Ghwasaan anda agooga goomiineadaysi aba hiji askwearda sean nea moosini gil?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha saawa, ‘Gweagu gideaba manda siida gooneasa gadiyeeda.’ Gwayeesha Siidida saawa, ‘Aweayeena eara agooga ak goosinyi gadiyeeda aba jeeda madamnyeanda sabiibu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gamikta aseeta, gaguursa siida bea madamnyeanda siidaanyi ahaaghwa fuga gadiyeeda ak gwayeesha, ‘Guursiina fuga gadiyeeda ak giidawi gidageatinda nyaawa, nea ging'eadi siida huuydean, ea gagul siida madeeda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahidu fuga gwachi siitaw gadiyeeda nea gaba aseeta damwanagi, ak gaba siisi siitaw dinaarajeanjagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hidu fuga gwachi bea madeeda ghaghay gili jea eataw lapiyeeda meaji ghwanaawda, amadu eara saawa gaba siisi siitaw dinaarajeanjagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ging'ooyda, gooniiksa siidida bea gheedean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayi, ‘Fiisu huuydeaniin gagadiiy aba jeemba aseadeanagi ak ghwahit, ak ginung' gwadeenyi lapiyeedeanya sea gea nyaawa nea gwachi aseasa geamilikghti gadiyeeda hang'waay sibwadi beasta askwearda sean.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha siyagi aba jeenyaawa, ‘Siida eaduupcheewi, aniini mwaayaagi gheanyangaagu; gwachi meeheeleesiini gideaba gaydagoonyi dinaari? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geanda gea was gaagu ak guwi; ghaabwariinyi gideaba gaydaadaw siisi huuydeaniin ooyang'deayeena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada ea mwadoabiiwa haleanjeedeanyu iyeagasayi dahinda gidaabwariiydi? Ghana gishti ghaang' aba gideaba geewooschi inya jihi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi, gwasunu eara fuga huuydean gayghoah fugeaba mwadi, nea fugeaba mwadi gayghoah fuga huuydean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabaloola deaba samwagu iita miyeadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gheeda nea ghwascheang'da Yesu gawa Yerusalemu, ghwaat giinealangiga atamaniyeenyean heeda funyaat ak gwayeesha aba naweeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ang'ula, ghamneawa geescheang'di geeweayi Yerusalemu; ak Orjeeda Siida gajeang'waay ak geayiin geatinga ashoohoodiga hees ea gea ng'oorshoodiga ak gajeergweaksiina miyeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gajeayaat ak geayiin geatinga Eemoojiga eeshka, nea geabwar aba mughoowooda, ak geengoor, ama eaweeteaba samwagu gaygwaduudu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidaghayi mus gheamata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Gheamata jiilu orjooga Sebedayo ak gawa heeda nea goodeayi orjoagaaschi ama hita gwatkuy ak gamus ng'ashaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha niny, “Gigasayi naaha?” Ak gwayeesha, “Rukuta gideaba orjusu ikeasu asiyeenyean nung' goopteada akaleala aba geatindaang'u bea dugwa ak ginung' goopteada niirja aba geatindaang'u ghaadaam aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeadaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Moanali eara gidoomuschi. Heapi! Ghoamuuschi aleayda gikoombeeyda jea daleayda aniini?” Gwayeesha, “Geamuuschi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu, “Sawanadeedeanyu gajoomilikghteaysiina, ama duuku giipteadayda geatindeanyu bea dugwa ea geatindeanyu ghaadaam, meandeawani uurda jea dagoona, geaghus eataw fuga ghayi nibay gwararsa Bwaabwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy Giinealangiga atamanamughuushiin ng'asheesu, gwanyareeksa orjoogiga asiyeenyean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa Yesu saawa ak gwayeesha, “Moanali gideaba fuga hees bea Eemoojiga goombaleegwa aba uurda nea fuga hees ikaanyaawa iissa ghaminighiseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea maygwasunu aba heedeang'wa nea siida gasa gwaheedu aba jeedeang'wa, ea doawa soomjeandeang'wa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siida wassean aba jeedeang'wa iigasa ghoah siida madeeda ea doawa giing'oonyaneedeang'wa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba sareani eara Orjeeda Siida moani eegadiyeesa niny ghoan gagadiiy, ak ghoadayda eaweagaaschi ghoah leadeeda fuga saang'a.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap fih iyeenya ng'oowi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu nea ghabeawa mujiineeda Yeriko ghwaat geeshta eemeetuw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean, gwanda ghuuta naweeda fih iyeenya ng'oowi nea goobiitpiit, hean iidu nea ghwayiiy gideaba ghang'ata Yesu ghwaat naweedida, goojuur nea gwayi, “Bwaydaneasa, Orjeeda Dawdi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goowoowsa eemeeda nea geeyeesha asiinda; saawa gabiikta goojuur muuchi nea gwayi, “Bwaydaneasa, Ng'utamiida Orjeeda Dawdi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamiinaada Yesu ak gaguursa ak gwayeesha, “Googasayi dasinneegwa naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha niny, “Ng'utamiida, geegasayi ghwajaada gheanyangaasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabwayda Yesu ak ghoang'waay gheanyanga nyaawa ama deagheata ghwajaada, ak ghwaat geeshta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
